{"step_index":181,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-16T00:47:12Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-15T18:47:12-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-15T18:47:13-06:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\nTotal segments loaded: 546\r\n[22:00] We believe your presence is here.\r\n[22:02] And we want it to be known, Lord, to the communities\r\n[22:04] around us, to our neighborhoods, to our workplaces,\r\n[22:07] to the schools our children go to, or even online.\r\n[22:11] Other activities that they do,\r\n[22:13] schemes that they play, Lord, that your presence in them\r\n[22:15] will be something that cannot be hid,\r\n[22:18] like a lamp set on a city set on a hill,\r\n[22:21] a lamp whose bushel has been removed.\r\n[22:23] Do that for us, Lord.\r\n[22:25] We commit our earthly needs to you as well.\r\n[22:26] There are any who are sick.\r\n[22:28] Some who are sick can't be here this morning\r\n[22:30] and others who deal with constant pain in their bodies.\r\n[22:32] Will you heal them?\r\n[22:33] Lord, you're a healing God.\r\n[22:35] We know that anyone who you touched,\r\n[22:37] when you were here on this earth, was healed immediately.\r\n[22:40] And you are the same yesterday, today and forever.\r\n[22:42] Jesus Christ is the same.\r\n[22:44] So we put our trust in that same Jesus,\r\n[22:47] but now has all things put under him,\r\n[22:49] under authority, under his authority.\r\n[22:52] Lay your hands on those that are healing, Lord,\r\n[22:54] and touch them and heal them completely.\r\n[22:56] Thank you for all the jobs you've given us,\r\n[22:58] the means to provide for our families\r\n[23:00] so that we don't have to be dependent on anyone else.\r\n[23:03] You're on the cattle on a thousand hills.\r\n[23:04] You know what we need, what the Gentiles,\r\n[23:09] the people of this world seek.\r\n[23:10] You know it, Lord.\r\n[23:11] And so we trust you to provide our needs.\r\n[23:13] Bless the work of our hands.\r\n[23:15] May you confirm the work of our hands, Lord.\r\n[23:18] Teach us to number our days.\r\n[23:19] You're coming as soon, the days are short\r\n[23:22] that we have here on this earth.\r\n[23:23] We wanna be ready.\r\n[23:25] Preserve us, Lord.\n<truncated 3231 bytes>\n that there were Pharisees and teachers of the law,\r\n[36:49] sitting by who had come out of every town\r\n[36:52] of Galilee,\r\n[36:54] Judea,\r\n[36:55] and Jerusalem.\r\n[36:57] And in this line,\r\n[36:58] it says,\r\n[36:59] and the power of the Lord was present to heal them.\r\n[37:02] And that same Jesus is here.\r\n[37:05] And it says that the Spirit of the Lord was upon him\r\n[37:08] to heal the broken hearted,\r\n[37:11] to set the captives free.\r\n[37:13] And that same Jesus,\r\n[37:15] and same resurrection powers we were singing about.\r\n[37:17] It's here today to heal,\r\n[37:20] and sickness to heal the broken hearted.\r\n[37:22] Perhaps even to heal any physical sickness,\r\n[37:25] if this is will.\r\n[37:26] But that same Jesus is here in this power of the Lord.\r\n[37:31] It's present to heal.\r\n[37:33] So thank God for His word concerning us.\r\n[37:37] So we,\r\n[37:42] this couple of events this week\r\n[37:45] will be this Wednesday at 630\r\n[37:48] for the sisters in meeting.\r\n[37:50] To be here at the church,\r\n[37:52] and also on Zoom.\r\n[37:54] And if those who want to join us online,\r\n[37:56] it'll be 630 this Wednesday on Mountain Time.\r\n[37:59] And if you want to join us,\r\n[38:01] and don't have that information,\r\n[38:03] please reach out to the elders.\r\n[38:06] Be that information is in the chat,\r\n[38:08] where you can look that up,\r\n[38:11] and just write it,\r\n[38:12] and tell us a little bit about yourself.\r\n[38:13] And then they can give you that information\r\n[38:16] for that Zoom link to join.\r\n[38:19] The sisters meeting this Wednesday.\r\n[38:22] Also the brothers will be meeting also here\r\n[38:25] at 7 a.m. on Saturday morning.\r\n[38:28] So those are two events.\r\n[38:30] Remember our book of the month,\r\n[38:34] actually the book for the rest of this year\r\n[38:36] would be basic Christian teachings,\r\n[38:38] my brothers, Zach.\r\n[38:40] It's in both audio form and also printed form\r\n[38:43] at rlcof.church slash books.\r\n[38:47] I didn't want to say that.\r\n[38:51] Remember where please come forward?\r\n[38:52] Moments 839,\r\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
