{"step_index":195,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-16T00:47:55Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-15T18:47:55-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-15T18:47:55-06:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/djtwo/.gemini/antigravity/brain/56930dde-d49e-4d64-b3a0-ddf3ad4cb3e8/.system_generated/tasks/task-189.log`\nTotal Lines: 143\nTotal Bytes: 9516\nShowing lines 1 to 100\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: [01:45:00 -> 01:45:04] fervently desire, earnestly desire to spend this time with you.\r\n2: [01:45:04 -> 01:45:08] And not only during that time, but throughout my whole life,\r\n3: [01:45:08 -> 01:45:11] every day there's this burning desire that the Lord longs.\r\n4: [01:45:11 -> 01:45:13] This is the greatest plan.\r\n5: [01:45:13 -> 01:45:16] I have many plans for you and their precious thoughts,\r\n6: [01:45:16 -> 01:45:20] but my greatest plan that it has for me,\r\n7: [01:45:20 -> 01:45:23] that it earnestly long to have fellowship with me.\r\n8: [01:45:23 -> 01:45:28] And I made the Lord continue to do this in our lives\r\n9: [01:45:28 -> 01:45:33] as I lay down my plans, my ambitions,\r\n10: [01:45:33 -> 01:45:36] and take up his plans, but the greatest plan\r\n11: [01:45:36 -> 01:46:16] to have that longing as he has that longing to have fellowship with him.\r\n12: [01:46:16 -> 01:46:19] I had to two longer conversations this week with people\r\n13: [01:46:19 -> 01:46:21] that I know just out in the world.\r\n14: [01:46:21 -> 01:46:24] And they were talking about all these deep trials\r\n15: [01:46:24 -> 01:46:27] that they had going on with their homes and their kids.\r\n16: [01:46:27 -> 01:46:29] Their kids were being expelled from school\r\n17: [01:46:29 -> 01:46:32] and drugs and addictions, and then they became adults\r\n18: [01:46:32 -> 01:46:36] and sexual confusion and out of jail and all these things.\r\n19: [01:46:36 -> 01:46:41] And I was listening to them.\r\n20: [01:46:41 -> 01:46:45] I was thinking to myself, what is i\n<truncated 3861 bytes>\nn anthem for my life,\r\n74: [01:49:32 -> 01:49:34] if I could have something that I could give to every person,\r\n75: [01:49:34 -> 01:49:36] every lost person that I come across,\r\n76: [01:49:36 -> 01:49:39] every person, another believer,\r\n77: [01:49:39 -> 01:49:42] wherever they are in maturity, it's this life\r\n78: [01:49:42 -> 01:49:43] that Christ is dwelling in me.\r\n79: [01:49:43 -> 01:49:45] Christ is producing his glory in me.\r\n80: [01:49:45 -> 01:49:47] Christ is forming something in me.\r\n81: [01:49:47 -> 01:49:48] It's more than right answers.\r\n82: [01:49:48 -> 01:49:52] It's that Christ has set apart his Lord and my heart\r\n83: [01:49:52 -> 01:49:57] and he's the life and the theme of my existence,\r\n84: [01:49:59 -> 01:50:00] my being.\r\n85: [01:50:00 -> 01:50:02] I was thinking about if you've ever had\r\n86: [01:50:03 -> 01:50:06] or made kombucha or kafir or sourdough,\r\n87: [01:50:08 -> 01:50:10] all these different things that have this,\r\n88: [01:50:10 -> 01:50:13] they have like a living and an active culture.\r\n89: [01:50:13 -> 01:50:16] And then I could give somebody a cup.\r\n90: [01:50:16 -> 01:50:17] It's like, I give you, here's the advice.\r\n91: [01:50:17 -> 01:50:18] I've faced this situation.\r\n92: [01:50:18 -> 01:50:19] Maybe I haven't faced this one.\r\n93: [01:50:19 -> 01:50:20] I don't have advice on that one.\r\n94: [01:50:20 -> 01:50:23] I give you a cup here because I've made this cup of kombucha\r\n95: [01:50:23 -> 01:50:26] and you try, like, all kombucha is pretty good.\r\n96: [01:50:28 -> 01:50:30] But how much better would it be\r\n97: [01:50:33 -> 01:50:35] if I could give somebody the life?\r\n98: [0